OL,3,GNEWSATardis-style police box installed 
OL,4,Ato deter crime                         
OL,6,FA functioning blue police box has been 
OL,7,Finstalled in a part of Watford town    
OL,8,Fcentre where more than 500 crimes were 
OL,9,Freported in a year.                    
OL,11,FThe steel box was installed on Thursday
OL,12,Foutside Metro Bank on the High Street. 
OL,14,FPolice boxes were commonly used as     
OL,15,Fsmall police stations last century and 
OL,16,Finspired the design of the Tardis in   
OL,17,FDoctor Who.                            
