OL,3,GNEWSATardis-style police box installed 
OL,4,Ato deter crime                         
OL,6,FWatford Borough Council granted        
OL,7,Fplanning permission for the box in May 
OL,8,F2025 after Hertfordshire Police said   
OL,9,F512 crimes had been reported in the    
OL,10,Fimmediate area over the previous year. 
